<view class="container"><view class="topbox"><block wx:if="{{infoData}}"><view class="text"> 业主信息：房屋面积<text>{{infoData.housesize}}</text>㎡；物业单价：<text>{{infoData.property_fee}}</text>元平方米/月；；物业服务时间：<text>{{infoData.property_time_str}}</text></view></block></view><view class="paycard"><view class="card-text"> 请选择您要缴纳的物业周期 </view><view class="card-box"><block wx:for="{{listData}}" wx:for-item="item" wx:for-index="index" wx:key="index"><block wx:if="{{listData&&listData[0]}}"><view data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['selectmonth',[index]]]]]}}" class="{{['mini-card',num===index?'active':'']}}" bindtap="__e"><view class="text4">{{''+item.property_month_num+''}}</view> 个月 <block wx:if="{{listData&&listData[0]&&item.presented_property_month_num_desc}}"><view class="tips">{{''+item.presented_property_month_num_desc+''}}</view></block></view></block></block><view class="input-card"><block wx:if="{{has_property_pay==1}}"><input class="mini-cards" type="text" value="{{notedata}}" placeholder-class="inputtext" placeholder="{{placeholder}}" data-event-opts="{{[['blur',[['btnblur',['$event']]]],['focus',[['btnfocus',['$event']]]],['input',[['__set_model',['','notedata','$event',[]]]]]]}}" bindblur="__e" bindfocus="__e" bindinput="__e"/></block><block wx:if="{{customtips}}"><view class="tips">{{''+presented_property_month_num_desc+''}}</view></block></view></view><block wx:if="{{diy_content}}"><view class="diybox"><view class="diytext">赠送物品</view><view class="diy_content">{{diy_content}}</view></view></block><view class="cell"></view><view class="paynum"><view class="text1"> 缴费总额 </view><view class="num">{{'￥'+total_price+''}}</view></view></view><view class="text2"> 计算公式：物业总价=房屋面积*物业单价*购买月份 </view><view class="text3">{{"注：单位(月）,自定义最大"+max_num+"个月"}}</view><button class="btn" style="{{('background-color:'+btncolor)}}" type="primary" data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['btnpay',['$event']]]]]}}" bindtap="__e">去支付</button></view>